From `packet-dcom.c`:
```c
int
dcom_register_routine(dcom_dissect_fn_t routine, e_guid_t* uuid)
{
        dcom_marshaler_t *marshaler;


        /* check if exists already */
        if (dcom_get_routine_by_uuid(uuid))
                return -1;

        marshaler = wmem_new(wmem_file_scope(), dcom_marshaler_t);
```

